00:05:36,000 --> 00:05:42,000
To honour a promise. To find his sons. To make his peace.

2
00:11:12,000 --> 00:11:18,000
The Water Diviner is a war, drama film directed by Russell Crowe.

3
00:16:48,000 --> 00:16:54,000
In 1919, Australian farmer Joshua Connor travels to Turkey to discover
the fate of his three sons, reported missing in action.

4
00:22:24,000 --> 00:22:30,000
Holding on to hope, Joshua must travel across the war-torn
landscape to find the truth and his own peace.

5
00:28:00,000 --> 00:28:06,000
Joshua Connor, played by Russell Crowe.

6
00:33:36,000 --> 00:33:42,000
Ayshe, played by Olga Kurylenko.

7
00:39:12,000 --> 00:39:18,000
Major Hasan, played by Yılmaz Erdoğan.

8
00:44:48,000 --> 00:44:54,000
Sgt. Jemal, played by Cem Yılmaz.

9
00:50:24,000 --> 00:50:30,000
Lt. Colonel Hughes, played by Jai Courtney.

10
00:56:00,000 --> 00:56:06,000
Arthur "Art" Connor, played by Ryan Corr.

11
01:01:36,000 --> 01:01:42,000
The Water Diviner is a 2014 drama film starring and directed by Russell Crowe, in his
directorial debut, and written by Andrew Anastasios and Andrew Knight.

12
01:07:12,000 --> 01:07:18,000
The film follows an Australian farmer, Joshua Connor (Crowe), who travels to Turkey
soon after World War I to find his three sons who never returned.

13
01:12:48,000 --> 01:12:54,000
It also stars Olga Kurylenko, Jai Courtney, Cem Yılmaz,
Yılmaz Erdoğan, and Jacqueline McKenzie.

14
01:18:24,000 --> 01:18:30,000
The Water Diviner had its world premiere at the State
Theatre in Sydney, Australia on 2 December 2014.

15
01:24:00,000 --> 01:24:06,000
It opened in Australian and New Zealand cinemas on Boxing Day 2014.

16
01:29:36,000 --> 01:29:42,000
The film had a limited release in the United States on 24 April 2015.

17
01:35:12,000 --> 01:35:18,000
At the 4th AACTA Awards, it won for Best Film and Erdoğan won
the AACTA Award for Best Supporting Actor.

18
01:40:48,000 --> 01:40:54,000
The film explores themes of australia, based on true story,
post world war i, farmer, missing in action.

19
01:46:24,000 --> 01:46:30,000
The tone is emotional.
